<title>Australia: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to February 28.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Cortecs			4.85	     6.59 2   Email			  4.07	     4.36</p>
<p>3   Pasminco		     2.40	     3.45</p>
<p>4   News Corp pref	     5.82	     3.37</p>
<p>5   News Corp		    6.86	     3.00</p>
<p>6   Coles Myer		   5.67	     2.35</p>
<p>7   Harvey Norman		6.08	     2.18</p>
<p>8   ANI			    1.43	     2.14</p>
<p>9   Advance Property	   1.49	     2.05</p>
<p>10  Burns Philp		  2.00	     2.04</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Delta Gold		   2.15	     -9.66</p>
<p>2   Fletcher Forest	    1.79	     -8.21</p>
<p>3   Fletcher Energy	    3.26	     -8.17</p>
<p>4   Australian Foundation    2.10	     -6.25</p>
<p>5   PMP Communications	 3.25	     -6.07</p>
<p>6   Fletcher Building	  3.80	     -5.94</p>
<p>7   Burswood Property	  1.44	     -5.88</p>
<p>8   Woodside Petroleum	 8.71	     -5.73</p>
<p>9   Bankwest		     2.55	     -5.56</p>
<p>10  Fletcher Property	  2.50	     -5.30</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
